      - It accepts `$set` (the array of sub-arrays) and `$order` (sorting direction).
      - Utilizes `usort` with a custom comparison callback to sort based on the `'age'` key within each sub-array.
      - Implements ascending (`asc`) and descending (`desc`) sorting based on `$order`.
      - Returns the sorted `$set` array.

